      "kind": "hypothesis",
      "title": "Investigation assessment",
      "detail": "Checkout service is down with HTTP 503, and its dependencies (payments, ledger) are also unreachable. The root cause is unconfirmed due to missing origin diagnostics. Current policies block all recovery actions because origin logs and request traces are unavailable. The dependency graph shows that failure in payments or ledger impacts checkout and storefront. However, without origin-level diagnostics, no supported action\u2014rollback, feature flag disable, or restart\u2014is justified. This incident requires origin telemetry to identify the root cause before any remediation can be proposed.",
